      "content": "that \"medieval castle\" and \"tunnels\" stuff is a bit much lol. can u just ignore the fantasy metaphors and give me the actual biochemistry? i specifically want to know about the enzymatic breakdown of the gluten and how the metabolic byproducts of the bacteria affect the physical structure of the dough.",
